      "statement": "The control plane has distinct chat/pipeline and file-executor paths: `Pipeline.run()` can auto-dispatch complex work to A2A, while `AgentRunner.run()` invokes file-capable executors against `cwd`; hybrid A2A roles can use either path according to role and target availability.",
